'''Freebuff''' is a free AI coding agent. You say what you want in normal language and it works on a real project: it reads the code, changes files, runs the program, checks the result and tells you what happened. The agent doing the work is called '''Buffy'''.

''Everything is on this page — five sections, no more. Words in yellow are links. This wiki is written for people who have never coded before.''

