== What can it do? ==
* '''Read a project:''' map an unfamiliar codebase, read big files by line range, search for a symbol or file.
* '''Change code:''' edit files, create new ones, run tests, builds and installers in a real terminal.
* '''Check its work:''' show a live preview of a website, drive a real browser, read console and network errors.
* '''Ship:''' publish a site with database, file storage and sign-in; work on a connected GitHub repository.
* '''Make content:''' documents, slides, spreadsheets, diagrams, images and simple page designs.
* '''Use your other apps:''' GitHub, Linear, Notion, Stripe, Google Drive, Discord, Telegram and MCP servers you approve.

== How much does it cost? ==
Freebuff is funded by '''text ads''' instead of a subscription. There are optional paid plans that add model time, and the balance is counted in '''hours''' (1 hour = 5 Freebucks).

